This license applies to the code in this repository (scripts, the site's
HTML/CSS/JS, and configuration) and to any written analysis or commentary
("insights") this project produces.

It does not apply to:

- `data/`, `site/covers.json`, and `site/jaapleest.json` — the compiled GV100
  rankings and the review links/age ratings/publisher names matched from
  jaapleest.nl. No copyright or license is claimed over this data; it is a
  factual record of a public reader vote and of published review metadata,
  used here as-is.
- `site/covers/` — book cover images. These are copyrighted by their
  respective publishers and illustrators, not by this project. They are
  included for identification purposes in a non-commercial, informational
  companion site, not relicensed.

Sources: this project's data and cover images draw on information published
by hebban.nl, jaapleest.nl, and goodreads.com. None of these sites endorse
or are affiliated with this project.

